# handy-guard word rules. saola setup put this file here.
#
# Speech recognition sometimes hears a name or a special word wrong. Add one
# rule per line in the form:   heard words => Correct Words
# A rule fires only on the exact phrase (case and punctuation do not count).
# A rule that starts with "^ " fires only at the start of a sentence.
#
# Examples (remove the "#" to use one):
# cube control => kubectl
# get hub => GitHub
# ^ except => accept
#
# After a change, restart handy-guard:   brew services restart saola
